  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "Given equation: 120 ÷ 12 × 6 + 24 - 15 = 27.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 12 and 6\n\nGiven: 120 ÷ 12 × 6 + 24 - 15 = 27\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**120 ÷ 6**__ × 12 + 24 - 15 = 27\n\n⇒ __**20 × 12**__ + 24 - 15 = 27\n\n⇒ __240____** + 24**__ - 15 = 27\n\n⇒ __264 - 15__ = 27\n\n⇒ 249 ≠ 27\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 12 and 15\n\nGiven: 120 ÷ 12 × 6 + 24 - 15 = 27\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**120 ÷ 15**__ × 6 + 24 - 12 = 27\n\n⇒ __**8 × 6**__ + 24 - 12 = 27\n\n⇒ __48 + 24__ - 12 = 27\n\n⇒ **__72__**__** - 12**__ = 27\n\n⇒ 60 ≠ 27\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 3) 12 and 24**\n\nGiven: 120 ÷ 12 × 6 + 24 - 15 = 27\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**120 ÷ 24**__ × 6 + 12 - 15 = 27\n\n⇒ __**5 × 6**__ + 12 - 15 = 27\n\n⇒ __**30 + 12**__ - 15 = 27\n\n⇒ __42** - 15**__ = 27\n\n⇒** 27 = 27**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 4) 6 and 24\n\nGiven: 120 ÷ 12 × 6 + 24 - 15 = 27\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**120 ÷ 12**__ × 24 + 6 - 15 = 27\n\n⇒ __**10 × 24**__ + 6 - 15 = 27\n\n⇒ __240 + 6__ - 15 = 27\n\n⇒ __246____ - 15__ = 27\n\n⇒ 231 ≠ 27\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
